@startuml Convoy Planning Process

title Process: planning a convoy
caption Target design. Decisions P15, O12, O13, D17, P14, P9, O7, P1, P2, P8, O4, O30, P11, D35. Plans 01, 04, 07, 10, 11, 12.

|Dispatcher|
start
:Create the convoy with its dates;
:Build the route: ordered points with names;
:Flag overnight stops and border crossings;
note right: the service never calculates routes (P15)

|Mechanic|
:Pass vehicle inspections;

|Dispatcher|
:Add inspected vehicles to the truck list;
:Publish the truck list;

fork
  :Allocate the budget by cost type;
  note right: optional; an unset budget only warns (O37)
fork again
  :Add vehicle equipment to vehicles;
fork again
  :Seat crew: one seat per person per convoy;
  :Nominate the Convoy Leader;
  :Record insurance covering every driver;
fork again
  :Book an outbound ferry per vehicle;
  :Set each vehicle's handover Receiver;
  |Freedom|
  if (Receiver registered?) then (no)
    :Refuse;
  else (yes)
  endif
  |Dispatcher|
fork again
  :Book accommodation per crew member\nat each overnight stop;
  :Or flag a crew member as arranging their own;
end fork

if (A driver is added later?) then (yes)
  :Seat the driver;
  :Update the insurance with the insurer and record it;
  note right: until then the driver is uncovered (O7)
else (no)
endif

if (A crew member leaves?) then (yes)
  :Remove the seat; insurance stays for the others;
  :Cancel or migrate their accommodation (task);
else (no)
endif

:Review readiness;
stop

@enduml
